# The census frame for `bin/devbin fleet`: every directory audit, doc and
# upgrade walk for devbin installs, one a line, `~` for the home directory.
#
# Tracked, so changing the frame is a commit someone can read (issue 0116).
# DEVBIN_FLEET_ROOTS overrides this file for one run. Every run also walks the
# rest of the home directory and names each install no root here covers, so a
# frame the disk has outgrown says so rather than going quiet.
~/Devel/prj
~/Devel/cfg
